            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibworo ekabaka, enapi ekapolon aburun, emaranete akanin nuka ituŋa luka akwap. Eswamakini kes kwape ejaar ekecerot, ido atubokini kes kwape atubonokiniata; ejenunete do ebe arai eoŋ EJAKAIT.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
